REGENT OF SAMPANG
EAST JAVA PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF SAMPANG REGENCY NUMBER 7 YEAR 2017
CONCERNING
WOMEN'S EMPOWERMENT AND CHILD PROTECTION
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE REGENT OF SAMPANG,

Considering : a. that every citizen has equal rights to live a dignified life in accordance with the principles of humanity, equality, and justice;
b. that women's empowerment is carried out so that women can actualize their potential optimally to participate in development according to their capacity;
c. that women who are vulnerable groups need to receive special protection so that they do not experience violence and can live a decent life according to the principles of humanity, equality and justice;
d. that with the enactment of Regulation of the Minister of Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 6 Year 2015 Concerning the System of Women's Empowerment and Child Protection, the regional government needs to improve the quality of life of women and protect children.
e. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, letter c, and letter d, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Women's Empowerment and Child Protection;

